"A pasted link that already contains the username and password fills those fields in. Credentials are stored in the keychain, never in plain preferences." = "A pasted link that already contains the username and password fills those fields in. Credentials are stored in the keychain, never in plain preferences.";
"The playlist is fetched live from the address you enter; nothing is copied into the app." = "The playlist is fetched live from the address you enter; nothing is copied into the app.";
"AutoBridge stores addresses only and fetches each list live from the project that publishes it, under that project's own terms. Nothing is hosted, bundled or redistributed here." = "AutoBridge stores addresses only and fetches each list live from the project that publishes it, under that project's own terms. Nothing is hosted, bundled or redistributed here.";
"Screen mirroring, touch injection into other apps and an arbitrary video surface on the car display are absent, not hidden: ReplayKit only captures this app's own screen, the App Sandbox has no equivalent of Shizuku or an accessibility input backend, and CarPlay is template-based with no mirroring category." = "Screen mirroring, touch injection into other apps and an arbitrary video surface on the car display are absent, not hidden: ReplayKit only captures this app's own screen, the App Sandbox has no equivalent of Shizuku or an accessibility input backend, and CarPlay is template-based with no mirroring category.";
"CarPlay here is the audio surface. It needs Apple's CarPlay audio entitlement to run on real hardware; without it the phone app is unaffected and the car scene simply never activates." = "CarPlay here is the audio surface. It needs Apple's CarPlay audio entitlement to run on real hardware; without it the phone app is unaffected and the car scene simply never activates.";
"Playlists and channels are fetched live from the projects that publish them, under those projects' own terms. Nothing is hosted, bundled or redistributed by AutoBridge." = "Playlists and channels are fetched live from the projects that publish them, under those projects' own terms. Nothing is hosted, bundled or redistributed by AutoBridge.";
"Skips crowd-sourced segments. The lookup asks sponsor.ajay.app for a four-character hash prefix of the video id, so the server is told a bucket of roughly 1 in 65,536 videos rather than which one is playing." = "Skips crowd-sourced segments. The lookup asks sponsor.ajay.app for a four-character hash prefix of the video id, so the server is told a bucket of roughly 1 in 65,536 videos rather than which one is playing.";
"Asks the page's own player for its best level once the player exists. A player that exposes no quality API is left alone." = "Asks the page's own player for its best level once the player exists. A player that exposes no quality API is left alone.";
"Presses Skip when YouTube offers it, and otherwise seeks an unskippable ad to its end. The ad is still fetched and may flash up for a frame. Every selector is YouTube's own internal class name, so this stops working without notice when they change it, and YouTube may answer with its \"ad blockers are not allowed\" interstitial — nothing here tries to defeat that check." = "Presses Skip when YouTube offers it, and otherwise seeks an unskippable ad to its end. The ad is still fetched and may flash up for a frame. Every selector is YouTube's own internal class name, so this stops working without notice when they change it, and YouTube may answer with its \"ad blockers are not allowed\" interstitial — nothing here tries to defeat that check.";

